  "heading": "Temporary custody of offender.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 167,
  "text": "Where a sentence of transportation or imprisonment is directed to be undergone in a civil prison, the offender may be kept in military or air force custody or in any other fit place, till such time as it is possible to send him to a civil prison.",
